# FORGE Linux package list (x86_64)
#
# Built on top of the Arch Linux "releng" profile baseline, trimmed to the
# packages FORGE actually ships.  Sorted alphabetically within sections.
#
# Conventions:
#   - one package per line, no version pins
#   - blank lines and `#` lines are ignored by mkarchiso
#   - any inline `# VERIFY` comment means "double-check this is in [core]/
#     [extra]/[multilib] today — it has moved or been renamed in the past".
#     Drop the comment once you've confirmed availability.

##############################################################################
# Base system
##############################################################################
amd-ucode
base
base-devel
intel-ucode
linux-firmware
linux-zen
linux-zen-headers
mkinitcpio
mkinitcpio-archiso
mkinitcpio-nfs-utils

